  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在北京生活了两年多，日子过得平常无奇。",
      "output_sha256": "a0b1f5ddb2ca464337ffb58e65fce28a7b5eb61a69793340e7b8d2ed84c36f51",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.511984,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ef6528d708e438298690a375e66925bba3b02787f6267e46d40aff907f6f779c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a0b1f5ddb2ca464337ffb58e65fce28a7b5eb61a69793340e7b8d2ed84c36f51",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要说福气，这也是福气了。",
      "output_sha256": "a0b582a4fccecf2f79d346e8682d79d252635fdaead20154041fe33049684890",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0b582a4fccecf2f79d346e8682d79d252635fdaead20154041fe33049684890",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因为平平常常，正像“糊涂”一样“难得”，特别是在“这年头”。",
      "output_sha256": "532060484f726adaa69c8000839d5e71669eb9717557b5be0a2204696ff894f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "532060484f726adaa69c8000839d5e71669eb9717557b5be0a2204696ff894f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但不知怎的，总不时想著在那儿过了五六年转徙无常的生活的南方。",
      "output_sha256": "3f607a7aa56840daa54f00c5860749e932ddbed9858af1fedcf9a55b3d801036",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f607a7aa56840daa54f00c5860749e932ddbed9858af1fedcf9a55b3d801036",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽说这种漂泊并非美好，但若谈到人生的滋味，或许更能让我深刻地体会到一些东西。",
      "output_sha256": "da5200921d065f8670719a1f84d2356e36efff20c444340234bf1adb86da9d91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.336948,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5916653c9089a7c5523e2b2279bdf0ab3ec5d39f8dac8a173b03457f296128cb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "da5200921d065f8670719a1f84d2356e36efff20c444340234bf1adb86da9d91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在终日看见一样的脸板板的天，灰蓬蓬的地；大柳高槐，只是大柳高槐而已。",
      "output_sha256": "893ec1c3ca91099e8339166ead68a12406a4f58e2c80778bb0ac7408e092df72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "893ec1c3ca91099e8339166ead68a12406a4f58e2c80778bb0ac7408e092df72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "心中无所牵挂，唯有自己和自己的家。",
      "output_sha256": "ba941a3481a596f113b5826db8bef5866a3b8affe5bcc7ccc0d95cc1c67df163",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.385958,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d8c6772165d49d741f33d3d397f16a5a8b6da3d5e4f337cc7255dd17ef7d1916"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba941a3481a596f113b5826db8bef5866a3b8affe5bcc7ccc0d95cc1c67df163",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想著我的渺小，有些战栗起来；清福究竟也不容易享的。",
      "output_sha256": "45f8986a825478db6c943c7dcf48451d0d105c43199886ea0fbee66e9002b917",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "45f8986a825478db6c943c7dcf48451d0d105c43199886ea0fbee66e9002b917",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这几天似乎有些异样。",
      "output_sha256": "8d57efbd0e455823dfbe64b0a6111a88643d42c01347d7648272c7e1dca9a773",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d57efbd0e455823dfbe64b0a6111a88643d42c01347d7648272c7e1dca9a773",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像一叶扁舟在无边的大海上，像一个猎人在无尽的森林里。",
      "output_sha256": "19dba1b67382042309e4fe0412ed4429d5a1f4635d407c9b42e779334c5ecc8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "19dba1b67382042309e4fe0412ed4429d5a1f4635d407c9b42e779334c5ecc8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走路，说话，都要费很大的力气；还不能如意。",
      "output_sha256": "fff10f264c6accae8c7fd8bdb6263d88cd02a27fb7866348c0af545f4e93b885",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "fff10f264c6accae8c7fd8bdb6263d88cd02a27fb7866348c0af545f4e93b885",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "心中是一团乱麻，亦可称之为一团火，似乎在挣扎着想要弄明白些什么，但最终似乎什么也没有弄明白。",
      "output_sha256": "afff9057d3532fb29a3f86f264d38ea71b56ef398df23dbe0b4dd19d23ec605c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.675397,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7e06c7d8a4769abc3823c2e95b08335d44514f8832a49a546a7d07d43219f7dc",
        "4b6d142f1334e81cb74ff3a70f1c2a931e93434dd7bf9d3f8b1b55706964e67d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "afff9057d3532fb29a3f86f264d38ea71b56ef398df23dbe0b4dd19d23ec605c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“一部《十七史》，从何处说起”，正可借来作近日的我的注脚。",
      "output_sha256": "789bacfbdb9734ed40261dec979539b60dfca11ce42072e083a2e994714beda8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "789bacfbdb9734ed40261dec979539b60dfca11ce42072e083a2e994714beda8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昨天忽然有人提起《我的南方》的诗。",
      "output_sha256": "8ec289356ca9984d7a247b9a384d99a459d89159c50f045edec8b80efcb78feb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ec289356ca9984d7a247b9a384d99a459d89159c50f045edec8b80efcb78feb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是两年前初到北京，在一个村店里，喝了两杯“莲花白”以后，信笔涂出来的。",
      "output_sha256": "dbee82fffe6eb44166781364781f5679d7367dbd2d255c3a0a2aa02203030bda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbee82fffe6eb44166781364781f5679d7367dbd2d255c3a0a2aa02203030bda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今回想起那一幕，似乎有些模糊；至于诗中所描绘的景象，更是遥不可及。",
      "output_sha256": "0990f1601f7db6bb6ea21469eac21c73d65a8aa276ce59da34a7ca6e96c78205",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.535307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5fe5ea1c5fa3814d4a9ae51af36c854502e0a1e31fb6e28dc600a276b4c8c562"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0990f1601f7db6bb6ea21469eac21c73d65a8aa276ce59da34a7ca6e96c78205",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，事情的巧合在于：今天午饭后，我无意中翻到一本旧杂志，竟然找到了三年前写给S的信。",
      "output_sha256": "a5df4ce7e8b10aa2e6d47d87af7eeb6dc8ff898a8fc8b9f9629400f2beaac3b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.535307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5fe5ea1c5fa3814d4a9ae51af36c854502e0a1e31fb6e28dc600a276b4c8c562"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5df4ce7e8b10aa2e6d47d87af7eeb6dc8ff898a8fc8b9f9629400f2beaac3b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "信里说著台州，在上海，杭州，宁波之南的台州。",
      "output_sha256": "8e4758eef142379804c124215c79411d00b5b2c07f542f3c068b865a86521c8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e4758eef142379804c124215c79411d00b5b2c07f542f3c068b865a86521c8f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这真是“我的南方”了。",
      "output_sha256": "a6d3c42f2ce67f4b1def6f54117dcc71c0e5b0085bdd4bc7b75d54d9664496cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6d3c42f2ce67f4b1def6f54117dcc71c0e5b0085bdd4bc7b75d54d9664496cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我正苦于想不出，这却指引我一条路，虽然只是“一条”路而已。",
      "output_sha256": "e2931e27cc79b05ac96aca30db3bd1a9193fcb39488ddcd1d28f431862b98ab5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "e2931e27cc79b05ac96aca30db3bd1a9193fcb39488ddcd1d28f431862b98ab5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不忘记台州的山水，台州的紫藤花，台州的春日，我也不能忘记S。",
      "output_sha256": "140775539f26f8c6880ce47ac97645fe2a2e4b69db024744b2d145f1d228ede9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "140775539f26f8c6880ce47ac97645fe2a2e4b69db024744b2d145f1d228ede9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他从前欢喜喝酒，欢喜骂人；但他是个有天真的人。",
      "output_sha256": "8d232cebcb861014c5c1d7ac43e2bfa8fb2ca28fd6f04fe8af7c603720083853",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d232cebcb861014c5c1d7ac43e2bfa8fb2ca28fd6f04fe8af7c603720083853",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他对朋友非常好。",
      "output_sha256": "e4b085a5e04eb6c83322607adbfec29626ba32f12213c691099bf7dcf74b18c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.44513,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f1e61ab7039dddcabfcd2a456a4e1e836deca3bf54c6a7e59074c362450f8f61"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e4b085a5e04eb6c83322607adbfec29626ba32f12213c691099bf7dcf74b18c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "L从湖南来到宁波找他，身无分文，他陪着L喝了半年酒才告别。",
      "output_sha256": "6f9f47e0f77a938af95ad611438bcf4506ddd2663933abdf3823f33f5a454f6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.643288,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af94b12428984c289130380aaf7cf9f05d89c32ccab7ba076e8e6103bcbb26ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6f9f47e0f77a938af95ad611438bcf4506ddd2663933abdf3823f33f5a454f6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "去年，他结婚了。",
      "output_sha256": "9bc0931237fd00f050035db157bd0efb0cf4f9a7fcb8baf07a7317c195d70aec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.558333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2451e97e3be9d4d1e8043ada12b6b71003850d7486fe2ca90336049282734daf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9bc0931237fd00f050035db157bd0efb0cf4f9a7fcb8baf07a7317c195d70aec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对于结婚的事，他曾烦恼了好几年，这算是落叶归根了；但他和我一样，快要迈入中年了吧。",
      "output_sha256": "242049073e4bfd9e1be4e0e39054bab7350e43cbad6322e4690086e0014346a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.600563,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d6393eccbeddb51f887b018b7a916908683f0887d5eb6359a1bda9b8ed4b9e99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "242049073e4bfd9e1be4e0e39054bab7350e43cbad6322e4690086e0014346a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "结婚后我们见过一次，匆匆的一次。",
      "output_sha256": "ab6eaadc5ba9c1b331d43bb9692dea482027cdb17df13cc0d58aaf0f86f0a764",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab6eaadc5ba9c1b331d43bb9692dea482027cdb17df13cc0d58aaf0f86f0a764",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，他也和一切人一样，结了婚终于是结了婚的样子了吧。",
      "output_sha256": "9dd08a1fdb69423c5e7bde3d6e374b4db104a4e46623875c05181133af121d4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "9dd08a1fdb69423c5e7bde3d6e374b4db104a4e46623875c05181133af121d4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我老只是记著他那喝醉了酒，很妩媚的骂人的意态；这在他或已懊悔著了。",
      "output_sha256": "38efa0efca58226b4810a96f8679a89705aa49f40e8494c112ad672e1962b06c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "38efa0efca58226b4810a96f8679a89705aa49f40e8494c112ad672e1962b06c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "南方这一年的变动，是人的意想所赶不上的。",
      "output_sha256": "f9d5eb0ef485d565d001a170f10937b855039694128dd0240b4cb23a2d7a99b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9d5eb0ef485d565d001a170f10937b855039694128dd0240b4cb23a2d7a99b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我起初还知道他的踪迹；这半年是什么也不知道了。",
      "output_sha256": "66750095d8dbd15d888ccee963ef81f73e508a8de207bd2ad347bfd7b07403cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "66750095d8dbd15d888ccee963ef81f73e508a8de207bd2ad347bfd7b07403cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他究竟是怎样经历这如狂风般的日子呢？",
      "output_sha256": "750a4dbb2b1740021bcdcfcdb95528ddee163ef326e454978cb8f171fd0cd7ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.585407,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2fad5fc95721759e35da1dc84b1ca9b000cf64627c4d7e168422f71f3733db0a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "750a4dbb2b1740021bcdcfcdb95528ddee163ef326e454978cb8f171fd0cd7ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我所思索的，就是这一点。",
      "output_sha256": "f2b03e27b42fd5d0cd60e9ca9598bbddcff1fbea1b2ff84f6f47238b657f1091",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.355,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "318e992f9b0e3ae8aff8d6588a8aef8c35e8ed5400690747bb3ae15b90c2bf43"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2b03e27b42fd5d0cd60e9ca9598bbddcff1fbea1b2ff84f6f47238b657f1091",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我曾说过大海，他就像是海面上的一朵小浪；我提到森林，他就是那森林中的一只小鸟。",
      "output_sha256": "576c06e8174c69405eeb6453d6caba61631da4fd472fb95de0ad75fccd6fb9ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.636535,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fa306e0c76b82cc719ed13099b16d61779176b2d715c9658ea1d1b31f9a201b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "576c06e8174c69405eeb6453d6caba61631da4fd472fb95de0ad75fccd6fb9ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "恕我，恕我，我向那里去找你？",
      "output_sha256": "f31f6f60b37b224f2ddce71717c20a552076cc3185b34176fef77d987a9fe583",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "f31f6f60b37b224f2ddce71717c20a552076cc3185b34176fef77d987a9fe583",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这封信曾印在台州师范学校的《绿丝》上。",
      "output_sha256": "1d30b2ff336bf61fe47ef0674d407c7232bef94b1daca0e0d31d7d78e8a20782",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "1d30b2ff336bf61fe47ef0674d407c7232bef94b1daca0e0d31d7d78e8a20782",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我现在重印在这里；这是我眼前一个很好的自慰的法子。",
      "output_sha256": "ae88c9a1f0d5a29d5e7971856919cbe78562f0c4362d17755d9b1d2cf8b487b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae88c9a1f0d5a29d5e7971856919cbe78562f0c4362d17755d9b1d2cf8b487b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "九月二十七日记。",
      "output_sha256": "8fbb3f4dd651c231ba2bdacff81720b8d9c7521dc5a1926b9b97566d98eb2bc2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "8fbb3f4dd651c231ba2bdacff81720b8d9c7521dc5a1926b9b97566d98eb2bc2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "S兄：",
      "output_sha256": "184ca5134147a0fcc6152ef1bd569981ca3b63f42d43e3fbb64eb84f3814e158",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "184ca5134147a0fcc6152ef1bd569981ca3b63f42d43e3fbb64eb84f3814e158",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……",
      "output_sha256": "a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我对于台州，永远不能忘记！",
      "output_sha256": "cdf6591dd8ba71d157d37c1f8927a05aac84031aa2271232479077cd8559ab8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdf6591dd8ba71d157d37c1f8927a05aac84031aa2271232479077cd8559ab8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我第一日到六师校时，系由埠头坐了轿子去的。",
      "output_sha256": "fe6be1e3e99afb3f1e43ba362591d5bb01f5dfd9179226f460f0f708413c2587",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "fe6be1e3e99afb3f1e43ba362591d5bb01f5dfd9179226f460f0f708413c2587",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "轿子走的都是僻静的小路；我很惊奇，堂堂一个府城，竟然如此冷清！",
      "output_sha256": "bc7ab1cda2021616320a714fda0a3c9f012a47db151d672192d1b2887740639b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.598333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1740b7819fab31f287a0fc9585943c6b606643cab5a1f927359540e1e919cd81"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bc7ab1cda2021616320a714fda0a3c9f012a47db151d672192d1b2887740639b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那时是春天，薄阴的天气和幽静的道路，让我仿佛置身于秋天的国度。",
      "output_sha256": "4e67688890bc7a1f3b83fcc4b1a2171cadb56902293332cee735d3c3c592a8c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.433874,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bf0b25023385c7bd78f95f43093ecf83d357ac94ca50c79d56d5598ee8e724f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4e67688890bc7a1f3b83fcc4b1a2171cadb56902293332cee735d3c3c592a8c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "约莫到了卖花桥边，我看见那清绿的北固山，下面点缀著几带朴实的洋房子，心胸顿然开朗，仿佛微微的风拂过我的面孔似的。",
      "output_sha256": "9be837f7dd3b1d2ee9f950931e400af8afc28bcede46756894986ecb21967dc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "9be837f7dd3b1d2ee9f950931e400af8afc28bcede46756894986ecb21967dc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到了校里，登楼一望，见远山之上，都幂著白云。",
      "output_sha256": "7ad8d8d37c3211b85cc48568775afe87ff8d2e7b2beba3409370f8b9d8b683f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ad8d8d37c3211b85cc48568775afe87ff8d2e7b2beba3409370f8b9d8b683f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "四面全无人声，也无人影；天上的鸟也无一只。",
      "output_sha256": "1bb49777dc010bfd288a180452e3f01670804e3659bed8c87aa75ce3b613c45e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bb49777dc010bfd288a180452e3f01670804e3659bed8c87aa75ce3b613c45e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "只有背后山上松风的细语隐约可闻。",
      "output_sha256": "440eb9df0dd4c0606c804681c9cdd6f61305305f5726a3e7be21811edaf68ae5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.492758,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b14e8390cbcbcf3952b291b2f00c61fbe5bd821dc0db8e2d73bf339a3b745438"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "440eb9df0dd4c0606c804681c9cdd6f61305305f5726a3e7be21811edaf68ae5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那时我真觉得自己如同脱离了尘世，飘然欲仙！",
      "output_sha256": "5797cea8dc37a4f1580f0a2ff918b7c2d5ecbfab54acd4cda94731d9dcfc00ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.443947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "59ecf850eed6a7429f2ac303c9e0063f66e58254ca8ac931bd5fe91d5ded341d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5797cea8dc37a4f1580f0a2ff918b7c2d5ecbfab54acd4cda94731d9dcfc00ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "后来我虽然发见了那座楼实在太坏了：柱子如鸡骨，地板如鸡皮！",
      "output_sha256": "7c81181af2590e59bab4094b37576cbbacc73f03628ec1476921a7cce399f2e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c81181af2590e59bab4094b37576cbbacc73f03628ec1476921a7cce399f2e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但自然的宽大使我忘记了那房屋的狭窄。",
      "output_sha256": "dc2887d5f16ef59d163a0e302997f3b83769ad097242feb1c6d7529ea625771e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc2887d5f16ef59d163a0e302997f3b83769ad097242feb1c6d7529ea625771e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我于是曾好几次爬到北固山的顶上，去领略那飕飕的高风，看那低低的，小小的，绿绿的田亩。",
      "output_sha256": "15ed310ad6173b10a878077e6b5ce12d14e0a89df21d178874c48d32da2fca26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "15ed310ad6173b10a878077e6b5ce12d14e0a89df21d178874c48d32da2fca26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是我最快乐的时光。",
      "output_sha256": "6840da227d0fd0e96d06d2578889b071904d3e83b145736ed88c6e936a804703",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.543624,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aacbadeba1bcdb6c2f67af4a2843a1532e1322416b2d79069fb5d25745a2bada"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6840da227d0fd0e96d06d2578889b071904d3e83b145736ed88c6e936a804703",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "信中提到紫藤花，我真的很喜欢那紫藤花！",
      "output_sha256": "1af4674e6eac0e719bcdcb9ba1f3ffac44d6460eee2b90c9de1f5989465faa0e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.555028,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a9f166a5aef5d50e8873079bc967eb90154bb572bc5c367ae4f4ce4e516808a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1af4674e6eac0e719bcdcb9ba1f3ffac44d6460eee2b90c9de1f5989465faa0e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那样朴陋——现在大概不那样朴陋了吧——的房子里，庭院中，竟有那样雄伟，那样繁华的紫藤花，真令我十二分惊诧！",
      "output_sha256": "1bd36a6fb424ada629f41e7ad8e5006808bee3001486b0e5b97b886bff76e961",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bd36a6fb424ada629f41e7ad8e5006808bee3001486b0e5b97b886bff76e961",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她的雄伟与繁华遮住了那朴陋，使人一对照，反觉朴陋倒是不可少似的，使人幻想“美好的昔日”！",
      "output_sha256": "ffa030fe6dc025719f91fc6bce50ab4eb1e5da7e6e9a6021e8091a760d701213",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "ffa030fe6dc025719f91fc6bce50ab4eb1e5da7e6e9a6021e8091a760d701213",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也曾几度在花下徘徊：那时学生都上课去了，只剩我一人。",
      "output_sha256": "f33f9dfd9783d0371d26939b8fef2d79e7a4dcd232cbb418fe8f2c8230191bef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "f33f9dfd9783d0371d26939b8fef2d79e7a4dcd232cbb418fe8f2c8230191bef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "暖和的晴日，鲜艳的花色，嗡嗡的蜜蜂，酝酿著一庭的春意。",
      "output_sha256": "c4cced6772e309e3ca24f888a8938751dc095d5a8e09181f900ad3af03076c22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4cced6772e309e3ca24f888a8938751dc095d5a8e09181f900ad3af03076c22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我自己如浮在茫茫的春之海里，不知怎么是好！",
      "output_sha256": "5b6ac2e8e33f8abc991f89169e90faf8378c2a776087f3e80f6e87ca39d6ba2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "5b6ac2e8e33f8abc991f89169e90faf8378c2a776087f3e80f6e87ca39d6ba2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那花真好看：苍老虬劲的枝干，这么粗这么粗的枝干，宛转腾挪而上；谁知她的纤指会那样嫩，那样艳丽呢？",
      "output_sha256": "42d7a2c240bd465b8b71614501d298b417eb8b98b0f8387f6220a708d1460056",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "42d7a2c240bd465b8b71614501d298b417eb8b98b0f8387f6220a708d1460056",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那花真好看：一缕缕垂垂的细丝，将她们悬在那皴裂的臂上，临风婀娜，真像嘻嘻哈哈的小姑娘，真像凝妆的少妇，像两颊又像双臂，像胭脂又像粉……我在他们下课的时候，又曾几度在楼头眺望：那丰姿更是撩人：云哟，霞哟，仙女哟！",
      "output_sha256": "e7e904a298682e62cffec685ad0e526645a19075df63b9c55c5340960a9479f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7e904a298682e62cffec685ad0e526645a19075df63b9c55c5340960a9479f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "离开台州后，我再也没有见过如此美丽的紫藤花，真让人思念，真让我嫉妒你们！",
      "output_sha256": "9eb6d88fec35c40e2e3f0a488a94e782ebc3890cbe52dd85f30b7f7de130a5f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.492758,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e89bd25e9069a506481465d1ac7eb74694d5905ec29bcd1990db143030dcf62"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9eb6d88fec35c40e2e3f0a488a94e782ebc3890cbe52dd85f30b7f7de130a5f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此外，南山殿望江楼上看浮桥(现在早已没有了)，看憧憧的人在长长的桥上往来著；东湖水阁上，九折桥上看柳色和水光，看钓鱼的人；府后山沿路看田野，看天；南门外看梨花——再回到北固山，冬天在医院前看山上的雪；都是我喜欢的。",
      "output_sha256": "0dadf0cffea173898716ce9da595f9e3b5ed04439a177abb09ef9cd564242fa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "0dadf0cffea173898716ce9da595f9e3b5ed04439a177abb09ef9cd564242fa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说来可笑，我还记得我从前住过的旧仓头杨姓的房子里的一张画桌；那是一张红漆的，一丈光景长而狭的画桌，我放它在我楼上的窗前，在上面读书，和人谈话，过了我半年的生活。",
      "output_sha256": "90ef1bd48ef89e85c23c0062d437cf97ee447b7a4b62730b848da579084d866d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "90ef1bd48ef89e85c23c0062d437cf97ee447b7a4b62730b848da579084d866d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在想已搁起来无人用了吧？",
      "output_sha256": "1e7807d817c2eee02e0f93c13545feddfa4547688fd9397e5ebe638225b752bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e7807d817c2eee02e0f93c13545feddfa4547688fd9397e5ebe638225b752bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唉！",
      "output_sha256": "7dd04a7742d7d3b342b1473618166c9d6669f5a726e5ca2c6250e029d483b13f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "7dd04a7742d7d3b342b1473618166c9d6669f5a726e5ca2c6250e029d483b13f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "台州的人真是朴实，和自然一般；我一年里只见过三个穿着上海装束的流氓！",
      "output_sha256": "6fe9dea43c409f1872455e41dbd010945aaebcaf74c909ca0d4faae8a95a6066",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": 0.788906,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
